{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月21日，英偉達在GTC柏林大會上發佈模塊化AI工廠參考設計DSX POD。該方案由合作夥伴將Vera Rubin系統及配套基礎設施預先集成到模塊化集裝箱中，在出廠前完成驗證。英偉達稱，在場地已完成準備的前提下，部署時間可從六個月縮短至最快14天。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583250.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.088710+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:46:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"f1d5c03906ea6cc90d40e58638cd736fe425c47c56beb83d0e0497bb4a5e2012","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}